  "Specification": "This module specifies a PlusCal algorithm with one distinguished process P1 and a family of processes P2 over process ids 2..4, all of which invoke a procedure Sum that increments a shared variable sum. The translated TLA+ model uses explicit program counters pc and per-process call stacks stack to represent procedure calls and returns, and it permits infinite stuttering after all processes reach \"Done\" to avoid deadlock at termination. The specification asserts the standard temporal behavior with Init and [][Next]_vars, includes weak fairness for the process actions and procedure body steps, and defines a termination property stating that eventually every process reaches the \"Done\" control location.",
